1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:54,600 --> 00:01:56,520
These Fire Spirit Beasts are endless !

25
00:01:57,160 --> 00:02:01,360
Our top priority is to activate the Country Sealing Formation.

26
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:05,240
Otherwise, even if we flee to Xuanwu,

27
00:02:05,480 --> 00:02:07,160
the Fire Spirit Beasts will follow us

28
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:10,680
and the country of Xuanwu will also be burned to the ground.

29
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:12,840
Senior Brother Song is right,

30
00:02:12,920 --> 00:02:14,400
we should act fast.

31
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:21,080
Order the army to cross the border at all costs !

32
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:23,720
After we activate the Country Sealing Formation,

33
00:02:23,960 --> 00:02:25,720
we will invade Xuanwu together !

34
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:38,520
Hold on ! If we can't cross,

35
00:02:38,720 --> 00:02:40,480
then the Burning Fire Alliance will perish here !

36
00:02:52,640 --> 00:02:53,440
What is this ?

37
00:02:53,480 --> 00:02:54,560
I have a bad feeling about this.

38
00:02:54,880 --> 00:02:56,160
Everyone, be careful !

39
00:03:03,320 --> 00:03:04,800
What are they doing ?

40
00:03:05,600 --> 00:03:06,580
What is this ?

41
00:03:06,120 --> 00:03:07,200
What the hell is this?

42
00:03:23,960 --> 00:03:25,840
Those beasts have... mutated !

43
00:03:26,880 --> 00:03:28,240
The Fire Spirit Beasts are growing stronger,

44
00:03:28,240 --> 00:03:29,480
we need to cross now !

45
00:03:29,520 --> 00:03:30,320
Charge !

46
00:03:33,200 --> 00:03:34,000
Follow me!

47
00:04:10,320 --> 00:04:11,800
Let's do this !

48
00:04:29,520 --> 00:04:30,760
Big brother !

49
00:04:41,080 --> 00:04:41,880
Big...

50
00:04:42,920 --> 00:04:43,720
brother...

51
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:51,160
Wan'er...

52
00:04:53,880 --> 00:04:54,520
No...

53
00:05:02,880 --> 00:05:03,560
Brother...

54
00:05:07,440 --> 00:05:09,240
Brother !

55
00:05:28,760 --> 00:05:30,720
The Fire Spirit Beasts come from here.

56
00:05:31,200 --> 00:05:33,480
Sealing this place should restrain these beasts.

57
00:05:34,280 --> 00:05:36,760
By using the Country Sealing Formation,

58
00:05:37,040 --> 00:05:40,360
we can trap all the Fire Spirit Beasts within the Burning Fire country.

59
00:05:40,400 --> 00:05:43,560
Fellow cultivators, let's begin.

60
00:06:07,440 --> 00:06:08,880
Fellow rogue cultivators,

61
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:12,200
we cannot operate this formation without you.

62
00:06:12,440 --> 00:06:13,920
We need Nascent Soul cultivators

63
00:06:13,920 --> 00:06:16,400
to use their Nascent Soul as fuel for the formation.

64
00:06:16,680 --> 00:06:19,560
It's the only way we have to seal the country.

65
00:06:19,960 --> 00:06:20,840
It's alright,

66
00:06:20,880 --> 00:06:22,680
we'll just lose a hundred years of spiritual energy.

67
00:06:22,880 --> 00:06:24,920
Since you are offering Spirit Restoration Pills,

68
00:06:25,360 --> 00:06:27,400
Then we will do our best for the Burning Fire Alliance !

69
00:06:28,880 --> 00:06:30,600
Fellow cultivators, focus on operating the formation.

70
00:06:30,720 --> 00:06:31,520
My sect

71
00:06:31,520 --> 00:06:33,360
will protect your physical bodies.

72
00:06:33,880 --> 00:06:34,840
I guarantee you

73
00:06:34,880 --> 00:06:37,480
that we will have established ourselves in Xuanwu in 3 months.

74
00:06:37,800 --> 00:06:38,920
When we succeed,

75
00:06:39,040 --> 00:06:42,440
I will personally come to welcome you all back.

76
00:06:50,800 --> 00:06:53,120
The Country Sealing Formation is activating ! Hurry up !

77
00:07:06,480 --> 00:07:07,720
Is this the Country Sealing Formation ?

78
00:07:07,880 --> 00:07:08,910
Let's see what they can do now.

79
00:07:08,960 --> 00:07:10,480
If the Fire Beasts are already this powerful,

80
00:07:10,640 --> 00:07:12,640
then I wonder how terrifying it would've been

81
00:07:12,800 --> 00:07:14,360
with the Fire Spirit Beast King.

82
00:07:15,920 --> 00:07:18,160
Brother Qiqing, fortune favors the brave.

83
00:07:18,360 --> 00:07:19,200
Junior Sister Muwan,

84
00:07:19,840 --> 00:07:21,560
we are at the border of Xuanwu,

85
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:23,560
you must stay focused.

86
00:07:34,160 --> 00:07:36,120
Country of Xuanwu

87
00:07:50,960 --> 00:07:53,640
Clear Heart Sect Ancestor

88
00:07:55,960 --> 00:07:56,760
Ancestor,

89
00:07:56,800 --> 00:07:59,320
I heard that the Burning Fire country is in shambles.

90
00:07:59,360 --> 00:08:00,240
Isn't it amusing ?

91
00:08:01,080 --> 00:08:03,600
Let's just watch the spectacle.

92
00:08:04,200 --> 00:08:05,480
When two tigers fight,

93
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:07,800
we can just reap the benefits.

94
00:08:11,800 --> 00:08:12,720
What's happening ?

95
00:08:21,200 --> 00:08:22,440
Fellow cultivators,

96
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:23,760
what does this mean !?

97
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:36,680
Clear Heart Sect disciples,

98
00:08:36,680 --> 00:08:38,320
follow me to retreat and seek reinforcements !

99
00:08:38,320 --> 00:08:39,520
Hurry up !

100
00:08:39,960 --> 00:08:41,520
You can't escape.

101
00:09:00,240 --> 00:09:02,400
You dared to violate the peace between our countries.

102
00:09:02,680 --> 00:09:04,920
Xuanwu's 50 major sects won't let that slide !

103
00:09:06,200 --> 00:09:09,760
Your Clear Heart Sect also stole that mountain once.

104
00:09:09,960 --> 00:09:13,400
It's just changing owners once again today.

105
00:09:14,200 --> 00:09:15,080
The Ancestor is dead !

106
00:09:15,080 --> 00:09:16,400
Retreat, quickly !

107
00:09:16,560 --> 00:09:17,840
Retreat !

108
00:09:36,160 --> 00:09:38,120
Unaware of your limits ?

109
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:38,920
Break !

110
00:09:40,560 --> 00:09:43,440
You can’t defend Heng Yue Mountain.

111
00:09:43,960 --> 00:09:45,840
Instead of letting others claim it,

112
00:09:46,240 --> 00:09:48,360
give it to my Xuan Dao Sect.

113
00:09:49,320 --> 00:09:51,800
Isn't this just the law of the jungle again ?

114
00:09:52,120 --> 00:09:53,120
Listen up.

115
00:09:54,120 --> 00:09:55,680
During the Fire Spirit Beast attack,

116
00:09:55,680 --> 00:09:58,480
the sects of Xuanwu ignored our pleas for help

117
00:09:58,520 --> 00:09:59,960
and watched from the side.

118
00:10:00,720 --> 00:10:02,320
They hoped that

119
00:10:02,560 --> 00:10:06,160
they would reap benefits from our loss.

120
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:08,480
We have no choice

121
00:10:08,800 --> 00:10:10,640
but to fight for our survival !

122
00:10:11,360 --> 00:10:12,600
For this war,

123
00:10:12,880 --> 00:10:14,800
every cultivator will be given an artifact.

124
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:18,920
Foundation Establishment cultivators will get a Core Formation artifact

125
00:10:18,920 --> 00:10:22,800
and Core Formation cultivators will get a Nascent Soul artifact.

126
00:10:23,280 --> 00:10:26,960
All the items you steal will be yours.

127
00:10:27,600 --> 00:10:30,400
The Alliance won't confiscate anything.

128
00:10:30,600 --> 00:10:33,400
Burning Fire Alliance !

129
00:10:33,760 --> 00:10:35,720
I should be able to find a way to escape

130
00:10:35,720 --> 00:10:37,600
amidst the chaos of this war.

131
00:10:37,760 --> 00:10:39,040
All the disciples

132
00:10:39,160 --> 00:10:40,520
will also be given

133
00:10:40,600 --> 00:10:42,960
a jade slip like this one.

134
00:10:43,800 --> 00:10:46,520
This jade records your kill count.

135
00:10:47,080 --> 00:10:49,640
For every 100 5th layer of Qi Condensation or above kills,

136
00:10:49,960 --> 00:10:51,880
you will get 10 mid-quality spirit stones.

137
00:10:52,360 --> 00:10:54,640
For every 20 Foundation Establishment kills,

138
00:10:55,120 --> 00:10:57,120
you will get 10 bottles of pills.

139
00:10:57,920 --> 00:10:58,840
These are good rules,

140
00:10:58,840 --> 00:11:00,680
they're based on your contribution.

141
00:11:01,680 --> 00:11:04,030
Watch me slaughter my way through Xuanwu.

142
00:11:03,160 --> 00:11:05,080
We'll get hundreds of spirit stones !

143
00:11:06,280 --> 00:11:08,360
Conflict never ends in this chaotic world...

144
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:12,720
Who knows if we will ever find true peace.

145
00:11:12,720 --> 00:11:13,480
Everyone,

146
00:11:13,520 --> 00:11:15,400
the Luo River Sect has other rewards.

147
00:11:15,760 --> 00:11:19,480
Each month, the person with the most kills will get a Heaven Separating Pill.

148
00:11:19,760 --> 00:11:21,960
The Luo River Sect is really going all out !

149
00:11:22,120 --> 00:11:23,160
Did I hear correctly ?

150
00:11:23,280 --> 00:11:24,480
A Heaven Separating Pill !?

151
00:11:24,840 --> 00:11:26,560
With a Heaven Separating Pill

152
00:11:26,800 --> 00:11:29,000
and with the Underworld Ascension Method,

153
00:11:29,240 --> 00:11:31,360
I'm 80% confident I can reach Core Formation.

154
00:11:31,400 --> 00:11:34,720
After that, I'll be the strongest under Nascent Soul...

155
00:11:34,720 --> 00:11:37,160
Alright, the war is about to begin.

156
00:11:37,160 --> 00:11:39,000
All Burning Fire Alliance disciples

157
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:41,320
will report to their assigned squad leader.

158
00:11:41,320 --> 00:11:42,120
Understood !

159
00:11:44,200 --> 00:11:47,520
Wang Lin, I have the map Lin Tao copied.

160
00:11:47,880 --> 00:11:49,240
I will give you the first piece now.

161
00:11:50,080 --> 00:11:52,640
If you kill 50 Foundation Establishment cultivators,

162
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:54,360
I will give you the second piece.

163
00:11:54,720 --> 00:11:55,920
If you can kill

164
00:11:56,200 --> 00:11:58,450
150 Foundation Establishment cultivators,

165
00:11:58,480 --> 00:12:00,680
I will give you the last piece.

166
00:12:02,680 --> 00:12:04,920
There is no room for negotiation here...

167
00:12:05,520 --> 00:12:07,110
It's either kill for rewards

168
00:12:07,360 --> 00:12:08,720
or die on the battlefield.

169
00:12:10,080 --> 00:12:12,640
The Ancestor played her cards well.

170
00:12:26,800 --> 00:12:29,960
Zhang Zili
Evil Devil Sect disciple
Early stage Core Formation

171
00:12:25,840 --> 00:12:28,600
The 10th squad has begun attacking the Spirit Vein

172
00:12:28,880 --> 00:12:31,120
so Xuanwu will surely send reinforcements.

173
00:12:31,320 --> 00:12:33,160
Our 8th squad's mission

174
00:12:33,160 --> 00:12:36,000
is to intercept anyone passing within 500 li.

175
00:12:36,880 --> 00:12:38,120
Now spread out.

176
00:12:38,480 --> 00:12:39,400
If you spot anyone,

177
00:12:39,440 --> 00:12:40,560
notify me immediately.

178
00:12:40,560 --> 00:12:42,000
Yes squad leader !

179
00:12:43,520 --> 00:12:45,880
With my Early stage Core Formation cultivation,

180
00:12:45,880 --> 00:12:48,360
I should be attacking sects in the 1st squad.

181
00:12:49,840 --> 00:12:52,080
This mission is too boring...

182
00:13:00,720 --> 00:13:01,840
Here, Burning Fire Alliance cultivators !

183
00:13:02,000 --> 00:13:03,160
Let's kill them all !

184
00:13:09,160 --> 00:13:10,080
Kill them !

185
00:13:10,320 --> 00:13:11,560
The reinforcements have arrived,

186
00:13:11,600 --> 00:13:14,120
it's too late for you to leave now !

187
00:13:17,160 --> 00:13:18,440
You will die here !

188
00:13:20,720 --> 00:13:23,360
You were fated to die by the Fire Spirit Beasts,

189
00:13:23,560 --> 00:13:25,280
stop clinging to your life !

190
00:13:30,360 --> 00:13:31,600
Foundation Establishment brat,

191
00:13:31,640 --> 00:13:33,320
the moment I get out of this,

192
00:13:33,320 --> 00:13:35,080
I will skin you alive

193
00:13:35,320 --> 00:13:36,560
and rip out your heart !

194
00:13:36,560 --> 00:13:39,400
It looks like this bloody war is unavoidable.

195
00:14:03,520 --> 00:14:05,400
This flying sword is strange. Retreat !

196
00:14:16,200 --> 00:14:17,920
Where do you think you're going ?

197
00:14:31,200 --> 00:14:33,400
How did this kid kill them ?

198
00:14:33,480 --> 00:14:36,280
Even I couldn't have killed 7 of them instantly.

199
00:14:36,800 --> 00:14:39,080
But he's just Middle stage Foundation Establishment...

200
00:14:39,160 --> 00:14:39,960
No !

201
00:14:40,200 --> 00:14:42,000
He must be hiding his cultivation.

202
00:14:43,360 --> 00:14:45,600
Over 100 cultivators are approaching from behind.

203
00:14:45,600 --> 00:14:47,720
8th squad, retreat to the Spirit Vein !

204
00:14:54,800 --> 00:14:57,960
Above the Spirit Vein
Country of Xuanwu

205
00:15:29,280 --> 00:15:30,080
Attack !

206
00:15:34,120 --> 00:15:34,720
Kill them !

207
00:15:35,280 --> 00:15:36,720
Burning Fire Alliance, charge !

208
00:15:36,760 --> 00:15:38,040
Fight to the death !

209
00:15:38,040 --> 00:15:39,440
Drive them out of Xuanwu !

210
00:15:54,240 --> 00:15:55,040
Come,

211
00:15:55,120 --> 00:15:56,280
bring it on !

212
00:16:05,680 --> 00:16:08,160
Ancestor, we are suffering heavy losses.

213
00:16:08,960 --> 00:16:10,440
Xuan Jia
Shennong Hall disciple
Early stage Core Formation

214
00:16:12,240 --> 00:16:14,240
Hong Tian
Shennong Hall Ancestor

215
00:16:14,080 --> 00:16:16,600
Even though he's only Foundation Establishment,

216
00:16:16,640 --> 00:16:20,080
he uses strange spells and artifacts.

217
00:16:21,080 --> 00:16:23,440
Go, kill him.

218
00:16:24,120 --> 00:16:24,800
Understood.

219
00:16:37,080 --> 00:16:40,040
Late stage Foundation Establishment ? They can't beat me.

220
00:17:02,480 --> 00:17:05,680
Master really is unmatched below Core Formation.

221
00:17:06,640 --> 00:17:09,760
But you still need to be careful when operating solo.

222
00:17:10,200 --> 00:17:12,160
What if a Core Formation cultivator appears ?

223
00:17:24,840 --> 00:17:26,760
Xuan Jia, go !

224
00:17:38,360 --> 00:17:40,360
You're just relying on your artifacts.

225
00:17:40,400 --> 00:17:42,680
I will put your miserable life to an end !

226
00:17:47,560 --> 00:17:51,320
Damn rat ! Do you have any other spell

227
00:17:51,360 --> 00:17:53,120
than your Earth Escape Technique !?

228
00:18:00,840 --> 00:18:03,280
Invader, I'll take your life !

229
00:18:14,790 --> 00:18:20,430
I've been walking this path for endless years

230
00:18:17,090 --> 00:18:20,430
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

231
00:18:21,070 --> 00:18:26,030
Is it the compass of fate

232
00:18:22,910 --> 00:18:26,030
that wrote this outcome for us ?

233
00:18:26,190 --> 00:18:31,950
The heavens want to erase your existence,

234
00:18:32,070 --> 00:18:37,670
that's the obsession guiding me.

235
00:18:37,950 --> 00:18:43,270
Is this the path to uncover

236
00:18:39,830 --> 00:18:43,270
truths from falsehoods ?

237
00:18:43,550 --> 00:18:48,870
In a world of murk and shadow,

238
00:18:45,450 --> 00:18:48,870
only the flame of truth can light the way.

239
00:18:48,910 --> 00:18:54,590
Look at them all,

240
00:18:51,790 --> 00:18:54,590
being carried by the waves.

241
00:18:55,030 --> 00:18:59,230
Look at them all,

242
00:18:57,190 --> 00:18:59,230
being drowned.

243
00:18:59,310 --> 00:19:02,550
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

244
00:19:02,590 --> 00:19:05,630
I will let the world refine my soul.

245
00:19:05,760 --> 00:19:11,190
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

246
00:19:07,450 --> 00:19:11,190
I will fight.

247
00:19:11,190 --> 00:19:14,310
I'll break through the abyss of despair

248
00:19:14,310 --> 00:19:17,350
to finally learn who I really am.

249
00:19:17,350 --> 00:19:22,710
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

250
00:19:19,230 --> 00:19:22,710
I embrace this obsession.

251
00:19:22,710 --> 00:19:25,670
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

252
00:19:25,670 --> 00:19:28,470
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

253
00:19:28,470 --> 00:19:33,950
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

254
00:19:30,510 --> 00:19:33,950
I'll still fight.

255
00:19:34,150 --> 00:19:37,310
It's hard to avoid loneliness

256
00:19:37,310 --> 00:19:40,350
when you are above everyone else.

257
00:19:40,350 --> 00:19:46,030
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

258
00:19:42,670 --> 00:19:46,030
be afraid of a firefly ?
